WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:02.667
♪♪

00:00:02.667 --> 00:00:03.901
[ Cheering, whistling,
and applause ]

00:00:03.901 --> 00:00:05.701
-Let's get to the news.

00:00:05.701 --> 00:00:08.534
The 94th Academy Awards
were held last night

00:00:08.534 --> 00:00:11.367
and featured
the first live performance

00:00:11.367 --> 00:00:12.968
of "We don't Talk About Bruno"

00:00:12.968 --> 00:00:15.434
from the Disney musical
"Encanto,"

00:00:15.434 --> 00:00:17.901
followed by an unbelievable live
performance of

00:00:17.901 --> 00:00:20.534
"We Don't Talk About Jada."
[ Laughter ]

00:00:20.534 --> 00:00:22.267
[ Applause ]

00:00:22.267 --> 00:00:26.901
Well, remember 24 hours ago when
we thought Timothée Chalamet's

00:00:26.901 --> 00:00:31.033
sternum was the craziest thing
we'd see all night?

00:00:31.033 --> 00:00:32.567
That's right.
Will Smith walked onstage

00:00:32.567 --> 00:00:33.934
during last night's
Academy Awards show

00:00:33.934 --> 00:00:35.501
and slapped Chris Rock
in the face.

00:00:35.501 --> 00:00:37.834
And I got to say
the last thing I ever expected

00:00:37.834 --> 00:00:40.667
to see at the Oscars was
a display of narcissism.

00:00:40.667 --> 00:00:43.100
[ Laughter ]

00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:44.868
We'll have more on this story
in a little bit,

00:00:44.868 --> 00:00:46.400
but first let me
do the rest of the monologue,

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:49.567
which is kind of terrifying
now that I know

00:00:49.567 --> 00:00:51.968
you can get slapped
for doing a bad joke.

00:00:51.968 --> 00:00:54.901
[ Laughter ]

00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:00.267
During his speech
on Saturday in Poland,

00:01:00.267 --> 00:01:02.434
President Biden spoke directly
to the Russian people

00:01:02.434 --> 00:01:04.133
and said that
President Vladimir Putin

00:01:04.133 --> 00:01:06.734
was to blame for
Western economic sanctions.

00:01:06.734 --> 00:01:08.734
'Cause if there's one thing
Biden loves,

00:01:08.734 --> 00:01:11.601
it's pointing fingers.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:11.601 --> 00:01:13.534
During a rally in Georgia
on Saturday,

00:01:13.534 --> 00:01:15.667
Republican Congresswoman
Marjorie Taylor Greene

00:01:15.667 --> 00:01:18.067
attacked Transportation
Secretary Pete Buttigieg

00:01:18.067 --> 00:01:20.000
and said, "He and his husband
can stay out

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:21.467
of our girls' bathrooms."

00:01:21.467 --> 00:01:24.000
Well, I can't believe I'm going
to say this -- she's right.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:25.167
[ Laughter ]

00:01:25.167 --> 00:01:26.901
Men use the men's bathroom.

00:01:26.901 --> 00:01:30.801
She got --
she got one right.

00:01:30.801 --> 00:01:32.167
According to a new report,

00:01:32.167 --> 00:01:35.334
Supreme Court Justice
Clarence Thomas' wife, Ginni,

00:01:35.334 --> 00:01:38.100
discussed ways to overturn
the 2020 election

00:01:38.100 --> 00:01:39.901
with then-White House
Chief of Staff Mark Meadows.

00:01:39.901 --> 00:01:42.000
But don't worry,
she'll get her comeuppance

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:44.968
when she's eliminated first
on "Dancing with the Stars."

00:01:44.968 --> 00:01:48.434
[ Laughter ]
Pepsi --

00:01:48.434 --> 00:01:49.834
[ Laughter ]

00:01:49.901 --> 00:01:53.167
You guys, Pepsi has --
[ Laughter ]

00:01:53.167 --> 00:01:55.033
Pepsi has announced
a partnership with

00:01:55.033 --> 00:01:59.000
the restaurant chain IHOP
to offer a Pepsi maple syrup.

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:00.467
Great if you love Pepsi,

00:02:00.467 --> 00:02:03.133
but you wish it took half
an hour to pour one.

00:02:03.133 --> 00:02:06.067
[ Laughter ]

00:02:10.868 --> 00:02:12.234
♪♪

00:02:12.234 --> 00:02:13.968
President Biden on Monday

00:02:13.968 --> 00:02:17.334
announced the so-called
billionaire minimum income tax

00:02:17.334 --> 00:02:19.100
as part of his 2023 budget --

00:02:19.100 --> 00:02:21.634
specifically, the part
they'll have to cut out

00:02:21.634 --> 00:02:22.767
before it will pass.

00:02:22.767 --> 00:02:24.767
[ Laughter ]

00:02:24.767 --> 00:02:28.534
President Biden yesterday signed
an anti-lynching bill into law

00:02:28.534 --> 00:02:31.934
and not, as I would have hoped,
President Buchanan.

00:02:31.934 --> 00:02:34.167
[ Laughter ]

00:02:35.868 --> 00:02:38.567
After meeting with
Judge Ketanji Brown Jackson

00:02:38.567 --> 00:02:39.834
yesterday for the second time,

00:02:39.834 --> 00:02:42.234
Republican Senator Susan Collins
told reporters

00:02:42.234 --> 00:02:44.868
she felt Jackson had met
her personal standard

00:02:44.868 --> 00:02:46.267
for serving
on the Supreme Court,

00:02:46.267 --> 00:02:49.767
which is blowing anything
under a .08 on a breathalyzer.

00:02:49.767 --> 00:02:51.567
[ Laughter ]

00:02:51.567 --> 00:02:53.267
The White House said yesterday

00:02:53.267 --> 00:02:55.501
that it would not invoke
executive privilege

00:02:55.501 --> 00:02:56.934
to shield Jared Kushner

00:02:56.934 --> 00:02:58.934
from testifying
before the House committee

00:02:58.934 --> 00:03:00.834
investigating
the Capitol attack.

00:03:00.834 --> 00:03:04.567
And if indicted,
he could be tried as an adult.

00:03:04.567 --> 00:03:06.534
[ Laughter ]

00:03:06.534 --> 00:03:08.901
After it was reported
that former President Trump

00:03:08.901 --> 00:03:11.000
may have communicated
during the Capitol attack

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:13.367
using so-called burner phones,

00:03:13.367 --> 00:03:15.234
Trump released a statement
on Monday that said,

00:03:15.234 --> 00:03:18.901
"I have no idea
what a burner phone is.

00:03:18.901 --> 00:03:23.267
To the best of my knowledge, I
have never even heard the term."

00:03:23.267 --> 00:03:24.734
[ Laughter ]

00:03:24.734 --> 00:03:26.567
I love the way he always goes

00:03:26.567 --> 00:03:29.734
a little too far
with his denials.

00:03:29.734 --> 00:03:30.868
It's like if someone said,

00:03:30.868 --> 00:03:32.534
"Hey, man, I haven't seen
your wife lately,"

00:03:32.534 --> 00:03:35.801
and you said, "I wouldn't even
know how to poison someone."

00:03:35.801 --> 00:03:37.467
[ Laughter ]

00:03:37.467 --> 00:03:41.067
"And I sure as hell
don't own a shovel."

00:03:41.067 --> 00:03:43.100
[ Laughter ]

00:03:43.100 --> 00:03:45.167
After facing criticism
for his plan

00:03:45.167 --> 00:03:47.534
to clear homeless encampments
from the city,

00:03:47.534 --> 00:03:49.901
New York Mayor Eric Adams
told reporters yesterday,

00:03:49.901 --> 00:03:51.767
"I'm like broccoli.

00:03:51.767 --> 00:03:54.133
You're going to hate me now,
but you're gonna love me later."

00:03:54.133 --> 00:03:56.534
Well, okay, but just speaking
for myself,

00:03:56.534 --> 00:03:59.100
it's been 48 years on broccoli.

00:03:59.100 --> 00:04:00.667
[ Laughter ]

00:04:00.667 --> 00:04:02.267
According to a new study,

00:04:02.267 --> 00:04:05.000
eating just two servings
of avocado a week

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:08.367
can reduce the risk of having
a heart attack by more than 20%.

00:04:08.367 --> 00:04:12.467
So, yeah, still no such thing
as affordable healthcare.

00:04:12.467 --> 00:04:14.434
[ Laughter ]

00:04:14.434 --> 00:04:17.901
Two avocados a week?

00:04:17.901 --> 00:04:21.234
Who's making
two-avocados-a-week money?

00:04:21.234 --> 00:04:23.367
[ Laughter ]

00:04:23.367 --> 00:04:25.234
Walgreens has announced plans

00:04:25.234 --> 00:04:27.701
to open robot-powered
fulfillment centers

00:04:27.701 --> 00:04:29.834
across the U.S.
to help fill prescriptions,

00:04:29.834 --> 00:04:31.667
with each robotic pharmacist

00:04:31.667 --> 00:04:34.300
able to complete
300 prescriptions an hour,

00:04:34.300 --> 00:04:35.734
which will give you more time

00:04:35.734 --> 00:04:38.634
to wait for someone
to come unlock the razors.

00:04:38.634 --> 00:04:41.701
[ Laughter ]

00:04:41.701 --> 00:04:45.100
[ As robot ]
Robot does not unlock razors.

00:04:45.100 --> 00:04:46.901
[ Normal voice ] Come on,
you've got robot hands.

00:04:46.901 --> 00:04:49.367
[ As robot ]
No, robot does not.

00:04:49.367 --> 00:04:52.200
Only fill prescriptions.

00:04:52.200 --> 00:04:53.400
That is Steve's job.

00:04:53.400 --> 00:04:54.400
[ Normal voice ]
Where's Steve?

00:04:54.400 --> 00:04:55.868
[ As robot ]
Steve is on break.

00:04:55.868 --> 00:04:57.467
[ Laughter ]

00:04:57.467 --> 00:04:58.634
No, robot --

00:04:58.634 --> 00:04:59.934
[ Laughing ]

00:05:01.567 --> 00:05:04.434
Steve never tell robot
where he is going.

00:05:04.434 --> 00:05:08.100
[ Laughter ]

00:05:08.100 --> 00:05:10.501
Make robot sad.

00:05:10.501 --> 00:05:12.467
Steve robot best friend.

00:05:12.467 --> 00:05:14.100
[ Laughter ]

00:05:17.934 --> 00:05:20.100
[ Laughs ]

00:05:20.100 --> 00:05:23.234
[ Normal voice ] According --
According to new reports,

00:05:23.234 --> 00:05:25.901
Apple is set to make
10 million fewer AirPods

00:05:25.901 --> 00:05:28.100
than anticipated this year
due to rising inflation,

00:05:28.100 --> 00:05:31.167
so maybe think twice before
walking over a sewer grate.

00:05:31.167 --> 00:05:33.400
"Aww!

00:05:33.400 --> 00:05:36.234
Aw, man, my AirPod.

00:05:36.234 --> 00:05:37.467
I don't got the money for more.

00:05:37.467 --> 00:05:39.567
I already bought
my two avocados."

00:05:39.567 --> 00:05:41.334
[ Laughter ]

00:05:41.334 --> 00:05:43.267
And finally, in honor of Easter,

00:05:43.267 --> 00:05:45.934
Disney World will offer
a so-called Boozy Bunny,

00:05:45.934 --> 00:05:47.667
which features
a chocolate rabbit

00:05:47.667 --> 00:05:48.968
filled with a bourbon drink.

00:05:48.968 --> 00:05:51.067
It's the perfect treat
for people who shouldn't be

00:05:51.067 --> 00:05:52.501
at Disney World.
[ Laughter,
cheers and applause ]

00:05:52.501 --> 00:05:53.868
♪♪

00:05:53.868 --> 00:05:55.467
President Biden spoke yesterday

00:05:55.467 --> 00:05:58.033
with Ukrainian President
Volodymyr Zelensky

00:05:58.033 --> 00:05:59.200
for nearly an hour.

00:05:59.200 --> 00:06:02.367
Zelensky secured
$500 million in aid

00:06:02.367 --> 00:06:06.000
and Biden somehow ended up
with a reverse mortgage.

00:06:06.000 --> 00:06:09.501
[ Laughter ]

00:06:09.501 --> 00:06:11.434
Intelligence officials
reportedly believe that

00:06:11.434 --> 00:06:12.968
Russian President Vladimir Putin

00:06:12.968 --> 00:06:16.601
has only recently learned how
poorly the invasion of Ukraine

00:06:16.601 --> 00:06:19.300
has been going and is angry
with his military advisers.

00:06:19.300 --> 00:06:20.601
And you can tell he's upset

00:06:20.601 --> 00:06:23.100
because now the table
is even longer.

00:06:23.100 --> 00:06:25.501
[ Laughter ]

00:06:25.501 --> 00:06:28.501
House Minority Leader
Kevin McCarthy said yesterday

00:06:28.501 --> 00:06:30.667
that Republican
Congressman Madison Cawthorn

00:06:30.667 --> 00:06:33.801
admitted that claims
that his fellow lawmakers

00:06:33.801 --> 00:06:37.400
had done cocaine and invited him
to orgies were exaggerated

00:06:37.400 --> 00:06:39.634
and added that Cawthorn
told him he,

00:06:39.634 --> 00:06:41.801
"Doesn't know what cocaine is."

00:06:41.801 --> 00:06:42.834
Guys.

00:06:42.834 --> 00:06:43.901
[ Laughter ]

00:06:43.901 --> 00:06:47.934
You got to keep
your denials believable.

00:06:47.934 --> 00:06:50.501
It's okay if you know
what cocaine is.

00:06:50.501 --> 00:06:52.067
I mean, look at this guy.

00:06:52.067 --> 00:06:53.701
[ Laughter ]

00:06:53.701 --> 00:06:56.767
He knows what cocaine is.

00:06:56.767 --> 00:06:58.167
Maybe he never did any.

00:06:58.167 --> 00:06:59.634
But every guy
who looks like that

00:06:59.634 --> 00:07:02.968
hangs out with eight other guys
who look exactly like that,

00:07:02.968 --> 00:07:06.300
and one of them
always has cocaine.

00:07:06.300 --> 00:07:08.834
"Oh, hold on. Yeah, no,
it's in my puffy vest."

00:07:08.834 --> 00:07:10.100
[ Laughter ]

00:07:10.100 --> 00:07:13.067
McCarthy also added that
Cawthorn has lost his trust,

00:07:13.067 --> 00:07:16.434
which is tough because, once
you lose Kevin McCarthy's trust,

00:07:16.434 --> 00:07:18.767
you almost immediately
get it back.

00:07:18.767 --> 00:07:20.634
[ Laughter ]

00:07:20.634 --> 00:07:22.667
Organizers of Sunday
night's Academy Awards

00:07:22.667 --> 00:07:24.067
said in a statement yesterday

00:07:24.067 --> 00:07:26.167
that Will Smith refused to leave
the Oscars

00:07:26.167 --> 00:07:28.200
after slapping Chris Rock
and added that they,

00:07:28.200 --> 00:07:31.667
"recognize we could have handled
the situation differently,"

00:07:31.667 --> 00:07:34.267
like maybe hiring
younger security guards.

00:07:34.267 --> 00:07:36.367
[ Laughter ]

00:07:36.367 --> 00:07:38.200
[ As Pacino ]
You got to go!

00:07:38.200 --> 00:07:39.200
[ Laughter ]

00:07:39.200 --> 00:07:42.167
[ As De Niro ]
Got to go.

00:07:42.167 --> 00:07:44.601
You got to go.

00:07:44.601 --> 00:07:45.901
I don't think he's going to go.

00:07:45.901 --> 00:07:47.200
[ Laughter ]

00:07:47.200 --> 00:07:48.100
[ As Pacino ]
Whoa!

00:07:48.100 --> 00:07:49.734
[ Light laughter ]

00:07:49.734 --> 00:07:52.234
[ Laughter ]

00:07:52.234 --> 00:07:55.133
New York Mayor Eric Adams spoke
at an event this week

00:07:55.133 --> 00:07:57.367
about the status
of the coronavirus pandemic

00:07:57.367 --> 00:07:59.934
and said, "Everyone
who moved to Florida,

00:07:59.934 --> 00:08:01.968
get your butts back
to New York City."

00:08:01.968 --> 00:08:03.934
Everybody?
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa.

00:08:03.934 --> 00:08:05.767
Let's not get carried away.

00:08:05.767 --> 00:08:07.767
[ Laughter ]

00:08:07.767 --> 00:08:09.767
Tomorrow is April Fool's Day.

00:08:09.767 --> 00:08:10.901
April Fool's!

00:08:10.901 --> 00:08:13.167
It's actually today,
because my show airs

00:08:13.167 --> 00:08:15.234
at an ungodly hour
of the morning.

00:08:15.234 --> 00:08:17.667
[ Laughter ]

00:08:19.534 --> 00:08:21.434
And finally, according
to a new study,

00:08:21.434 --> 00:08:23.801
men who eat
excessive amounts of meat

00:08:23.801 --> 00:08:25.567
increase the risk
of becoming infertile.

00:08:25.567 --> 00:08:27.567
So get ready for that
to be an excuse.

00:08:27.567 --> 00:08:29.868
"Baby, we don't need condoms,
I just had ribs."

00:08:29.868 --> 00:08:31.267
[ Laughter ]

00:08:31.267 --> 00:08:33.234
And that was the monologue,
everybody.

00:08:33.234 --> 00:08:36.834
♪♪

00:08:36.834 --> 00:08:39.300
[ Cheering, whistling,
and applause ]

